Oracles: FloatDomainParityTests
Fails: the text sweep, on most exponent-form doubles, about one in three hundred others in its digits, and 2^-25 and 2^-958 in their value; the inlined 2^-25 constant matches no stored bound
History: #153, measured against PostgreSQL 16, 17 and 18

